  { q: 'Kya meri jankari private rahegi?', a: 'Haan, 100%. Aapki baat sirf ilaaj ke liye use hoti hai. Dawa aisi packing me bheji jaati hai jis par kuch nahi likha hota, aur hum aapki jankari kisi ko nahi bechte. Detail Privacy Policy me hai.' },
